codex
The incumbent is hard to beat by constants, so I’m testing a structural baseline: direct reuse of the official target input RNG rows instead of spherical/radialized probes. If the finite Monte Carlo target noise dominates, direct samples should benefit from that correlation; if the expectation error dominates, it will be worse.
